        "original_id": "a9f1b950-cd1c-5d01-a6f7-bb9ee85924e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Gatwick Airport, Heathrow Airport, Central London, Crawley, London, south-east England, United Kingdom\n- Products: IATA codes LGW and LHR, ICAO codes EGKK and EGLL\n\nFacts:\n- Gatwick Airport, also known as London Gatwick, is a major international airport in south-east England, 29.5 miles south of Central London and 2.7 nautical miles north of Crawley.\n- Gatwick Airport has the IATA code LGW and the ICAO code EGKK.\n- Gatwick Airport is the second-busiest airport in the United Kingdom by total passenger traffic, after Heathrow Airport.\n- Heathrow Airport, also known as London Heathrow, is a major international airport in London, United Kingdom.\n- Heathrow Airport has the IATA code LHR and the ICAO code EGLL.",
